952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e774", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 11335.2, "width": 270.7, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g142"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1929625277, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1300551083, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WHY +/-25% JITTER, NOT FULL JITTER", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHY +/-25% JITTER, NOT FULL JITTER", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e775", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 11358.8, "width": 1061.7, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g142"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 728146282, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 779481354, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Full jitter (a random value between 0 and the cap) is the right tool for an uncapped exponential in a client library. On a fixed ladder it can return a\nnear-zero delay for a late rung, which defeats the backoff. The goal of jitter here is only to desynchronise a herd, and +/-25% does that.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Full jitter (a random value between 0 and the cap) is the right tool for an uncapped exponential in a client library. On a fixed ladder it can return a\nnear-zero delay for a late rung, which defeats the backoff. The goal of jitter here is only to desynchronise a herd, and +/-25% does that.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e776", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 11436.8, "width": 1120, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g143"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 584791292, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 719344551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e777", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 11450.8, "width": 178.7, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g143"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2056622757, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2048189202, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PARKING IS NOT FAILING", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "PARKING IS NOT FAILING", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e778", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 11474.2, "width": 1088.8, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g143"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1324951216, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 93599289, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "When tryAcquire() is false the worker re-schedules the delivery a few seconds out WITHOUT incrementing attempt: parking is not failing, and must\nnot burn the ladder. A slow partner, not a failing one, is what exhausts workers - so the gate is a per-endpoint bulkhead (max in-flight) plus a breaker\n(open for 30 s after 5 consecutive failures).", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "When tryAcquire() is false the worker re-schedules the delivery a few seconds out WITHOUT incrementing attempt: parking is not failing, and must\nnot burn the ladder. A slow partner, not a failing one, is what exhausts workers - so the gate is a per-endpoint bulkhead (max in-flight) plus a breaker\n(open for 30 s after 5 consecutive failures).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e779", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 11572.2, "width": 1120, "height": 91.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ef4444", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g144"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 563011104, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1602963156, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e780", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 11586.2, "width": 223.2, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g144"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1538963539, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1480856073, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CLASSIFY FIRST, THEN DECIDE", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CLASSIFY FIRST, THEN DECIDE", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e781", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 11609.8, "width": 1084.2, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g144"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 679643414, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1984764679, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Retrying a 400 is noise; retrying a 503 is the whole point; a 401 means stop and tell someone. Never follow redirects: a 3xx from a partner endpoint\nis dead, not retry (SSRF and loop risk).", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Retrying a 400 is noise; retrying a 503 is the whole point; a 401 means stop and tell someone. Never follow redirects: a 3xx from a partner endpoint\nis dead, not retry (SSRF and loop risk).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e782", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 11713.8, "width": 2280, "height": 52, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g145"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 591911628, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 638674268, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e783", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 11713.8, "width": 110, "height": 52, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g145"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 8099487, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1549564217, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e784", "type": "text", "x": 76, "y": 11723.8, "width": 54.6, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g145"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1622751108, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1278972873, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "05.3", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "05.3", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e785", "type": "text", "x": 190, "y": 11723.8, "width": 189.2, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g145"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1968082010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1730138133, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "hmac_signing", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "hmac_signing", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e786", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 11787.8, "width": 2280, "height": 49.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g146"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1361461764, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2032566911, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e787", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 11801.8, "width": 1575.2, "height": 21.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g146"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2025614272, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 140299621, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sign the timestamp together with the raw body. The same scheme protects both directions: our webhooks to partners, and their callbacks to us. The timestamp bounds replay; the inbox handles the rest.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sign the timestamp together with the raw body. The same scheme protects both directions: our webhooks to partners, and their callbacks to us. The timestamp bounds replay; the inbox handles the rest.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e788", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 11865.0, "width": 2280, "height": 880, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g147"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 52090872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1773860857, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e789", "type": "text", "x": 110, "y": 11881.0, "width": 656.4, "height": 21.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 502223970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 230342033, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SIGN  -  our webhooks to partners; partners sign their callbacks to us the same way", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "SIGN  -  our webhooks to partners; partners sign their callbacks to us the same way", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e790", "type": "rectangle", "x": 110, "y": 11935.0, "width": 230, "height": 80, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle