alse, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "First, superusers and roles with BYPASSRLS ignore policies, so the application role must be neither. Second, the scheduler has to claim work across tenants, which RLS forbids. Resolve it with a narrow SECURITY DEFINER function, owned by a restricted role, that returns only (delivery id, tenant id);\neverything after the claim runs inside withTenant. The tenant id comes from the verified event or the authenticated principal - never from a request body.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "First, superusers and roles with BYPASSRLS ignore policies, so the application role must be neither. Second, the scheduler has to claim work across tenants, which RLS forbids. Resolve it with a narrow SECURITY DEFINER function, owned by a restricted role, that returns only (delivery id, tenant id);\neverything after the claim runs inside withTenant. The tenant id comes from the verified event or the authenticated principal - never from a request body.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1277", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 21070.2, "width": 319.5, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#15803d", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 814551600, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2109709176, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tenant boundary, layer by layer", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tenant boundary, layer by layer", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1278", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 21111.8, "width": 2280, "height": 700, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "b