ates, unsigned checkpoints) and fail toward delivery on anything that cannot (a stale push token, a slow partner, a lagging chain that is safely buffered). That is the opposite\nof the rate limiter's default, and being able to say why is worth more than either answer alone.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The rule: fail closed on anything that can hurt a person or the audit record (consent-based sends, operator actions, unclassified templates, unsigned checkpoints) and fail toward delivery on anything that cannot (a stale push token, a slow partner, a lagging chain that is safely buffered). That is the opposite\nof the rate limiter's default, and being able to say why is worth more than either answer alone.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1750", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 26870.2, "width": 2400, "height": 2981.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 32, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 388126310, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 812182659, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1592", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 26910.2, "width": 64, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g319"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 831382917, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1275310495, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1593", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 26917.2, "width": 29.8, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,