 any prompt; secret scanning pre-commit; AI-assisted PRs are labelled and a named human owns every merged line.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1776", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 30569.5, "width": 540, "height": 221.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g354"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 755937701, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 127295908, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1777", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 30583.5, "width": 73.2, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g354"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1938650579, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1187203972, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Design", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Design", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1778", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 30617.0, "width": 501.5, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g354"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1942554167, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 59669989, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Claude as adversary, not author. I write the design against a fixed\ntemplate, then ask it to attack specific scenarios: consent withdrawn\nbetween enqueue and send; relay crash after publish; a partner 200\nwith an error in the body; skewed clocks against signature\ntimestamps; a replay naming another tenant's loan. The output is\nhypotheses I triage. Also a first-pass STRIDE model, Mermaid\ndiagrams, ADR drafts, and AsyncAPI or JSON Schema drafts of the\ncontracts.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Claude as adversary, not author. I write the design against a fixed\ntemplate, then ask it to attack specific scenarios: consent withdrawn\nbetween enqueue and send; relay crash after publish; a partner 200\nwith an error in the body; skewed clocks against signature\ntimestamps; a replay naming another tenant's loan. The output is\nhypotheses I triage. Also a first-pass STRIDE model, Mermaid\ndiagrams, ADR drafts, and AsyncAPI or JSON Schema drafts of the\ncontracts.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1779", "type": "rectangle", "x": 640, "y": 30569.5, "width": 540, "height": 221.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8b5cf6", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g355"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1797911745, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1973773733, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1780", "type": "text", "x": 654, "y": 30583.5, "width": 52.9, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g355"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 101022492, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 553843006, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Build", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Build", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1781", "type": "text", "x": 654, "y": 30617.0, "width": 512.2, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g355"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1688723670, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1102376974, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cursor or Claude Code on bounded, spec-first work: migrations, RLS\nscaffolds, DTOs generated from the schema registry, the\nsigned-webhook client, Terraform modules, runbook skeletons. I write\ninterfaces, invariants and failing tests; the agent fills in; I read every\ndiff. A rules file encodes house constraints, and Semgrep and lint\nrules enforce them in CI - models forget rules, linters do not. Claude\nalso reviews every PR with a security prompt, alongside the human\nreviewer.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cursor or Claude Code on bounded, spec-first work: migrations, RLS\nscaffolds, DTOs generated from the schema registry, the\nsigned-webhook client, Terraform modules, runbook skeletons. I write\ninterfaces, invariants and failing tests; the agent fills in; I read every\ndiff. A rules file encodes house constraints, and Semgrep and lint\nrules enforce them in CI - models forget rules, linters do not. Claude\nalso reviews every PR with a security prompt, alongside the human\nreviewer.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1782", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 30569.5, "width": 540, "height": 221.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g356"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1523872158, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1588215892, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1783", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 30583.5, "width": 44.0, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#15803d", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g356"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1388749011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1635630562, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Test", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Test", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1784", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 30617.0, "width": 494.6, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g356"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2116186278, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1038147297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "AI is strongest at breadth. I state the invariants; it writes the\ngenerators. A fake partner server with every nasty behaviour:\ntimeouts, slow-drip bodies, 429 with Retry-After, flapping 5xx, bad\nsignatures, replays, duplicates, reordering. Format-valid fake PANs\nand phone numbers; k6 scripts for an EMI-day burst profile that I\nspecify; chaos scripts. Mutation testing (Stryker, PIT) grades the\nAI-written tests, because they tend to mirror the implementation.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "AI is strongest at breadth. I state the invariants; it writes the\ngenerators. A fake partner server with every nasty behaviour:\ntimeouts, slow-drip bodies, 429 with Retry-After, flapping 5xx, bad\nsignatures, replays, duplicates, reordering. Format-valid fake PANs\nand phone numbers; k6 scripts for an EMI-day burst profile that I\nspecify; chaos scripts. Mutation testing (Stryker, PIT) grades the\nAI-written tests, because they tend to mirror the implementation.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1785", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1800, "y": 30569.5, "width": 540, "height": 221.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g357"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 119760474, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 217017765, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1786", "type": "text", "x": 1814, "y": 30583.5, "width": 84.7, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g357"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 310950410, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 682218098, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Operate", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Operate", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1787", "type": "text", "x": 1814, "y": 30617.0, "width": 513.5, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g357"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1621244390, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 12407105, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A read-only copilot over scrubbed dashboards and logs: \"which\npartners' failure rate moved after the 14:05 deploy\", draft LogQL or\nSQL that I run, cluster DLQ errors by signature, draft postmortem\ntimelines, keep runbooks aligned with code, draft partner-facing delay\nexplanations for a human to send. It never holds write credentials.\nReplay, purge, secret rotation and consent changes go through the\nMFA'd console with maker-checker.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A read-only copilot over scrubbed dashboards and logs: \"which\npartners' failure rate moved after the 14:05 deploy\", draft LogQL or\nSQL that I run, cluster DLQ errors by signature, draft postmortem\ntimelines, keep runbooks aligned with code, draft partner-facing delay\nexplanations for a human to send. It never holds write credentials.\nReplay, purge, secret rotation and consent changes go through the\nMFA'd console with maker-checker.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1788", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 30835.0, "width": 353.0, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2017304388, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 427245491, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011952237, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Where I deliberately do not trust AI", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Where I deliberately do not trust AI", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1789", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 30876.5, "width": 2280, "height": 33.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "